  "findings": {
    "P18": "Seven real LHcase poses reveal finite lower peripheral wall depth, rounded forward corner, separate projecting boss groups and service apertures. Casting JE541038 does not establish finished catalogue SKU or RDC equivalence.",
    "P16": "Seller passenger footrest is bare triangular stay, not rubber or hinge; already modelled family, no new rubber child justified.",
    "P20": "Mounted airbox-to-carb boot and clamp visible on assembled airbox; opposite mouth/internal lip still obscured. Exact label and variant require check.",
    "P17": "Rectangular ribbed rubber has reverse recesses, not identified as DG161124. No stand-damper manufacture from seller title."
  },
